# Iran Technology and Innovation Management Association

## Stack

- Nuxt and Vue 3. Only `<script setup lang="ts">`.
- Routes live in `app/pages/`. Components live in `app/components/` and are auto-imported.
- Data comes only from `content/` via `@nuxt/content` and `queryCollection`. Do not hardcode interface or body copy in components.
- Images use `NuxtImg` or `NuxtPicture` from `@nuxt/image`.
- Static output with `nuxt generate`.

## RTL

The site is fully right-to-left (`lang=fa` and `dir=rtl` on `html`). Logical properties only.

```html
<!-- bad -->
<div class="ml-4 pl-6 text-left left-0">
<!-- good -->
<div class="ms-4 ps-6 text-start start-0">
```

`left`, `right`, `ml`, `mr`, `pl`, `pr`, `text-left`, and `text-right` are forbidden. A directional icon (arrow, chevron) gets `rtl:-scale-x-100`.

## Design

هدف، کپی ۱:۱ مارکاپ و CSS سایت ifp.org است، آینه‌شده برای RTL. فقط متن، تصاویر، لوگو و فونت عوض می‌شوند. هیچ کامپوننتی از روی توضیح متنی بازسازی نمی‌شود؛ منبع حقیقت فایل‌های ref/ifp/ است. کلاس‌های اصلی IFP (site-header، home-splash، home-spotlight-intro، post-listing__*، project-list--layout-3-col، newsletter-pre-footer، site-footer و...) دقیقاً حفظ شوند.

- The global stylesheet is `app/assets/css/ifp.rtl.css`, built with rtlcss from `ref/ifp/css/main.css` and the `<style>` blocks in `ref/ifp/html/`. Both Söhne and Tiempos Text map to `IRANYekan, Tahoma, sans-serif`. Uppercase and letter-spacing are neutralized; font-weight stays.
- IFP colours in that sheet are custom properties on `:root`. Paper is `#FFFDF5`, ink and rules are `#2B2B33`, the hero is `#2D317A` with paper text, emphasis is `#6866AD` for text, links, icons, and hairlines, and `#6A64AB` for solid fills. The newsletter, footer, and dark header are `#06011E`. Meta stays `#999`. Panels are `#FAF9F7`. Topic colours cycle `#2D317A`, `#6967AC`, `#9A96CA`, `#3F50A0`. Label text on `#9A96CA` is `#06011E`. Text on `#6866AD` and `#6A64AB` is `#FFFDF5`.
- Tailwind preflight is off. Use Tailwind only for association-specific UI.
- Headings, text, and labels use IRANYekan (`font-heading`, `font-sans`, and `font-serif`), with Tahoma as the fallback. The FaNum woff2 and woff files live in `public/fonts/iranyekan/` and are declared in `app/assets/css/fonts.css`.
- Display dates are Jalali with Persian digits (`formatPersianDate`). Keep dates as ISO in content.

## Content and SEO

- Every page calls `usePageSeo` with a Persian title and description and `ogLocale: fa_IR`.
- Temporary content, including the first structure taken from IFP, sets `placeholder: true` in frontmatter.
